Subject: [PATCH 089/104] probe: collect vkd3d Vulkan capability evidence

---
 programs/winehua_vulkan_smoke/main.c | 138 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 133 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

